{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>Those who regard</b> — a transitive verb, and the reference is to the men of the ship, who were calling to him, and one would reprove another." "<b>And their kindness</b> — because they thought they were performing kindness. Or its meaning is like: it is kindness."], :book :jonah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Jonah -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=19&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:07:05.009365500Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}